OL,3,GNEWSAChildren in Need funds
OL,4,Alife-changing, charity says
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I know how many applicants that
OL,7,FChildren In Need have and they have to
OL,8,Fprocess, but to actually have the
OL,9,Ffunding, it's life-changing probably
OL,10,Ffor some of these young people that we
OL,11,Fare working with."
